,title,link,text,language,family
0,Music of Tibet - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_Tibet,"The music of Tibet reflects the cultural heritage of the trans-Himalayan region centered in Tibet, but also known wherever Indigenous Tibetan groups are found in Nepal, Bhutan, India and further abroad.",Kachari,Sino-Tibetan
1,PDF Folk songs of the Sonowal Kacharis: A Brief Discussion - JETIR,https://www.jetir.org/papers/JETIR2406186.pdf,0.2 AIM AND OBJECTIVES OF THE STUDY:- a) To conduct a systematic study of folk songs prevalent among the Sonowal Kachari people. b) To be aware of the classification and content of Sonowal Kachari folk songs. c) Determine the place of Sonowal Kachari folk songs in Assamese folk literature.,Kachari,Sino-Tibetan
