5,Role of Sonowal Kachari Haidang Geet As Folk Media - Ierj,https://ierj.in/journal/index.php/ierj/article/view/1290,"The Haidang Geet is the unique type of ritualistic folk song which not only give recreational or ritualistic communication but also describe about the creation of the universe, their deities with their social and ritual life. The present paper has made an attempt to discuss on Sonowal kachari Haidang Geet and its role as Folk media.",Kachari,Sino-Tibetan
